{"fetchedAt":"2026-11-01T00:14:17.371Z","pushedAt":"2026-10-28T15:30:54Z","branch":"main","issues":0,"watchers":2,"size":50510,"homepage":null,"archived":false,"files":431,"truncated":false,"readme":{"path":"README.md","html":"<h2 id=\"vibe-knowledge--vibe-知识大赏\">vibe-knowledge · Vibe 知识大赏</h2>\n<p><strong>一个知识点 → 一条有旁白、每句有出处的精品知识短片。</strong><br />\nClaude Code skill：选题 → 查证 → 写稿 → 配音 → 代码成片 → 1080p60 → 质检 → 发布包，全程在对话里完成。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-2f7d4f\" alt=\"MIT\" /></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/SKILL.md\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Claude%20Code-skill-d97757\" alt=\"Claude Code skill\" /></a> <a href=\"https://renoise.ai/mcp?utm_medium=xcom&amp;utm_source=official\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/video-Renoise%20MCP-ff7a1a\" alt=\"Renoise MCP\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/README.en.md\">English</a> · <a href=\"#%E7%9C%8B%E6%A0%B7%E7%89%87\">看样片</a> · <a href=\"#%E9%A3%8E%E6%A0%BC%E5%BA%9344-%E5%A5%97--8-%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%8F\">风格库</a> · <a href=\"#%E5%90%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%90%AC%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E9%9F%B3%E8%89%B2%E4%B8%8E-bgm\">听一听</a> · <a href=\"#renoise%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA%E6%A1%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0\">Renoise</a> · <a href=\"#%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85\">安装</a></p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/style-flash.gif\" width=\"720\" alt=\"风格快闪片\" /><p><sub>↑ 风格快闪片节选。完整 42 秒版：<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/style-flash-42s.mp4\">style-flash-42s.mp4</a></sub></p>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"看样片\">看样片</h2>\n<p>点封面播放（视频放在 <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/tag/v1.0.0\">Release v1.0.0</a>）。所有画面都由 Claude Opus 编排、代码逐帧渲染；标「增强」的镜头用 <a href=\"https://renoise.ai/mcp?utm_medium=xcom&amp;utm_source=official\">Renoise</a> 生成配图和动态镜头，片中都标注「AI 示意」。</p>\n<table>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep04b-no-fridge-gufeng.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep04b-no-fridge-gufeng.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>如果你活在古代没有冰箱（古风版）</b><br /><sub>2:05 · 两难选择片 · 古风 · 增强标准档（Wan 3.0 动态镜头）</sub></td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep01-shangyang.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep01-shangyang.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>商鞅立木：搬一根木头赏五十金，你搬不搬？</b><br /><sub>2:32 · 两难选择片 · 古风 · 增强档</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep01-shangyang-base.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep01-shangyang-base.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>商鞅立木（基础档，0 积分）</b><br /><sub>2:32 · 同一份 film.js，代码插画版</sub></td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep01-tiers-compare.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep01-tiers-compare.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>商鞅立木 · 两档上下对比</b><br /><sub>2:32 · 基础档 vs 增强档，旁白和脚本完全一样</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep02-paper-to-moon.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep02-paper-to-moon.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>一张纸折多少次能到月球</b><br /><sub>1:10 · 猜谜概念片 · 深色数学 + 尺度穿越 · 增强标准档</sub></td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep03-money-laundering.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep03-money-laundering.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>什么是洗钱</b><br /><sub>1:31 · 痛点原理片 · 半调拼贴 · 增强轻档</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep04-no-fridge.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep04-no-fridge.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>如果你活在古代没有冰箱</b><br /><sub>3:12 · 猜谜概念片 · 星空光点 · 基础档 0 积分（同一选题的另一种讲法）</sub></td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/ep05-rocket.mp4\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/posters/ep05-rocket.jpg\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><b>火箭怎么飞上天</b><br /><sub>1:46 · 猜谜概念片 · 蓝图专利图 · 增强标准档</sub></td></tr>\n</table><p><strong>风格样片集</strong>（每套风格演同一段「商鞅立木」开场，方便横向比较）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-01-core7.mp4\">最早 7 套（古风、星空光点、暗金线描、水墨纸本、像素、字幕新闻、视觉调查）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-02-edit-doc.mp4\">剪辑与纪实</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-03.mp4\">补空白家族 8 套</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-04-enhanced.mp4\">增强档：敦煌、青花、木刻、半调拼贴</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-05.mp4\">第五批 8 套</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-06.mp4\">第六批 8 套</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-07-enhanced.mp4\">增强档：长卷、铜版博物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-08-farm-pixel.mp4\">田园像素</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-09.mp4\">第九批 5 套</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/download/v1.0.0/styles-10-sketch.mp4\">手绘过程（手 + 笔画给你看）</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"风格库44-套--8-个家族\">风格库：44 套 · 8 个家族</h2>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/main/docs/style-wall.jpg\" alt=\"44 套风格\" /><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>家族</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n<th>风格（点开看 STYLE.md：配色、字体、镜头语言、适合的选题）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>东方</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/gufeng/STYLE.md\">古风</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/paper/STYLE.md\">水墨纸本</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/dunhuang/STYLE.md\">敦煌壁画</a>（增强）、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/qinghua/STYLE.md\">青花</a>（增强）、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/woodcut/STYLE.md\">木刻</a>（增强）、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/minimal/STYLE.md\">留白极简</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/scroll/STYLE.md\">长卷</a>（增强）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗场概念</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/starfield/STYLE.md\">星空光点</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/darkgold/STYLE.md\">暗金线描</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/darkmath/STYLE.md\">深色数学</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/neon/STYLE.md\">霓虹赛博</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/keynote/STYLE.md\">发布会极简</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/aurora/STYLE.md\">极光</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/deco/STYLE.md\">装饰艺术金线</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>游戏</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/pixel/STYLE.md\">像素</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/rpg/STYLE.md\">RPG 对话框</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/cards/STYLE.md\">卡牌对战</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/farm/STYLE.md\">田园像素</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剪辑与纪实</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/caption-news/STYLE.md\">字幕新闻</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/investigation/STYLE.md\">视觉调查</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/desktop/STYLE.md\">复古桌面</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/lighttable/STYLE.md\">档案灯台</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/tvnews/STYLE.md\">电视新闻包装</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明亮流行</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/variety/STYLE.md\">综艺花字</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/memphis/STYLE.md\">孟菲斯波普</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/journal/STYLE.md\">手账涂鸦</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/vapor/STYLE.md\">蒸汽波</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/clay/STYLE.md\">黏土卡哇伊</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图解与设计</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/chalk/STYLE.md\">粉笔黑板</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/blueprint/STYLE.md\">蓝图专利图</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/isometric/STYLE.md\">等轴测剖面</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/swiss/STYLE.md\">瑞士网格动态字</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/metro/STYLE.md\">地铁线路图</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/isotype/STYLE.md\">象形统计</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/copper/STYLE.md\">铜版博物</a>（增强）、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/sketch/STYLE.md\">手绘过程</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印刷与纸</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/riso/STYLE.md\">孔版印刷</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/collage/STYLE.md\">半调拼贴</a>（增强）、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/ransom/STYLE.md\">剪报拼字</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/editorial/STYLE.md\">杂志编辑</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/poster/STYLE.md\">国家公园海报</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电影感</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/titles/STYLE.md\">剪影片头</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/silent/STYLE.md\">默片字卡</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/styles/constructivist/STYLE.md\">构成主义蒙太奇</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「增强」= 需要 Renoise 生图（约 8 积分 / 段），其余全部代码生成、0 积分。给出选题后，<code>recommend.py</code> 会推荐 3 套风格；你也可以从空白开始定一套自己的风格（<code>references/09-style-studio.md</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"听一听默认音色与-bgm\">听一听：默认音色与 BGM</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音频</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/docs/audio/default-voice-demo.m4a\">default-voice-demo.m4a</a></td>\n<td>默认配音音色「科技博主沉稳男声」，小米 MiMo 音色设计生成的 AI 声音，不是真人；快节奏，5.5–6 字/秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/docs/audio/mix-demo-voice-plus-bgm.m4a\">mix-demo-voice-plus-bgm.m4a</a></td>\n<td>成片混音效果：旁白 + 默认 BGM + 音效（第 04 期 B 版开头 24 秒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/skills/vibe-knowledge/assets/music/vibe-bgm.m4a\">vibe-bgm.m4a</a></td>\n<td>默认 BGM（112.9 BPM，160 秒），每条视频都会用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>BGM 是强制的</strong>：混音时如果 film.js 没放 BGM，会按片长自动裁一份补上；别的整段配乐会被停用；音量统一校准到「说话时比人声低 10 dB」。只有用户明确要求换曲才换（音乐条目写 <code>bgm: true, user_request: \"用户原话\"</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"它怎么做一期\">它怎么做一期</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>做什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>① 选题</td>\n<td>3 秒内能不能让人先猜 / 先选？有没有贯穿全片的道具？有没有反转？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>确认 1</strong></td>\n<td>选题、6 种母版之一、<strong>时长</strong>（按复杂度给四档：速览 / 精讲 / 标准 / 深挖，每档写清能讲多细、要砍掉什么）、风格、档位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>② 查</td>\n<td>事实清单 <code>facts.md</code>：每个数字、人名、年份、引文都有出处；说法有分歧时两说并列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>③ 写</td>\n<td>按母版写旁白 → 子 agent 对抗审查（钩子、出处、字数）→ 改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>确认 2</strong></td>\n<td>看旁白稿 + 分镜（增强档附带镜头清单和 Renoise 报价），同意后才生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>④ 配音</td>\n<td>MiMo 克隆音色 + 逐字对齐 + 回读校验 + 人声后期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>⑤ 编</td>\n<td><code>film.js</code>：组件库 <code>know.js</code>（配图推拉、逐帧视频、关键词、计数器、竖排古文、出处脚注、两难按钮、印章、线稿剖面图…）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>⑥ 渲</td>\n<td>1080p60 逐帧录制 → 混音（强制 BGM、按人声校准）→ 封面接成开头帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>⑦ 质检</td>\n<td>接触表 + OCR 回读对照 facts.md + 响度 + 冻结检测 + BGM 检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>确认 3</strong></td>\n<td>看成片 → 发布包（标题、话题、简介、封面）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>两档制作</strong>：基础档 0 积分（Opus 手写 SVG 分层插画、粒子、数据组件）；增强档只把代码做不好的镜头（写实场景、最需要被记住的 1–3 个时刻）交给 Renoise，每次先报价、你同意了才生成。同一份 film.js 两档通用。</p>\n<p><strong>六种母版</strong>：猜谜概念片、两难选择片、痛点原理片、一条主线片、闯关片、六面轮转片（<code>references/01-templates.md</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"renoise增强档的生成平台\">Renoise：增强档的生成平台</h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://renoise.ai/mcp?utm_medium=xcom&amp;utm_source=official\">Renoise</a></strong> 是一个 AI 视频、图片、音频生成平台，通过 MCP 直接接进 Claude Code、Codex 等 Agent。一个账号就能用 Midjourney、GPT Image、Nano Banana、Seedance 2.5、Wan 3.0、Kling、Grok Video、Lyria、ElevenLabs 音效等模型，在对话里直接生成。</p>\n<p>在 vibe-knowledge 里，Renoise 只负责<strong>增强档</strong>里代码做不好的那几个镜头：写实的时代场景配图、最需要被记住的 1–3 个动态镜头、个别音效。其余画面照样用代码画。<strong>基础档完全不需要 Renoise，0 积分就能出片。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先报价、你点头才生成</strong>：每一期都会把要生成的镜头、模型、提示词和 <code>estimate_cost</code> 总价列给你，你在对话里明确同意才提交。</li>\n<li><strong>花多少心里有数</strong>：第 01 期《商鞅立木》增强版用了 246 积分（10 张 Midjourney 配图 + 2 个 Wan 动态镜头 + 配乐 + 5 个音效）；增强档一般在轻 ≈25–40 / 标准 ≈250–300 / 旗舰 ≈600–700 积分。</li>\n<li><strong>片中标注</strong>：Renoise 生成的画面都会标「AI 示意」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>还没有账号？先到 <a href=\"https://renoise.ai/mcp?utm_medium=xcom&amp;utm_source=official\">renoise.ai</a> 注册</strong>。登录都在浏览器里完成，不用复制任何 API key。然后按你用的 Agent 接入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用的是</th>\n<th>怎么接</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Claude Code</strong></td>\n<td>依次输入 <code>/plugin marketplace add ArcoCodes/renoise-plugins-official</code>、<code>/plugin install renoise@renoise-plugins-official</code>，首次调用时浏览器登录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Claude 桌面端 / claude.ai</strong></td>\n<td>设置 → 连接器 → <strong>Add custom connector</strong> → 名称 <code>Renoise</code>，地址 <code>https://renoise.ai/api/public/mcp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Codex</strong></td>\n<td><code>codex mcp add renoise --url https://renoise.ai/api/public/mcp</code>，再 <code>codex mcp login renoise</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OpenClaw</strong></td>\n<td><code>openclaw plugins install renoise --marketplace ArcoCodes/renoise-plugins-official</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>WorkBuddy、Cursor、Windsurf、Cline、豆包、千问、纳米Work……</strong></td>\n<td>添加远程 MCP 服务器，地址 <code>https://renoise.ai/api/public/mcp</code>（常见配置：<code>{\"mcpServers\":{\"renoise\":{\"url\":\"https://renoise.ai/api/public/mcp\"}}}</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>官方最新装法：<a href=\"https://renoise.ai/plugin\">renoise.ai/plugin</a>。装好后问 Agent 一句「查一下我的 Renoise 余额」，能查到就接通了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装\">安装</h2>\n<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge.git\ncp -R vibe-knowledge/skills/vibe-knowledge vibe-knowledge/skills/ai-teardown ~/.claude/skills/\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><code>vibe-knowledge</code> 是本体；<code>ai-teardown</code> 提供 cine 渲染引擎、建工作区和配音脚本，两个都要装。</li>\n<li>渲染用的 Python：<code>python3 -m venv ~/.venvs/cine &amp;&amp; ~/.venvs/cine/bin/pip install numpy scipy pillow playwright &amp;&amp; ~/.venvs/cine/bin/python -m playwright install chromium-headless-shell</code>，再 <code>export CINE_PY=~/.venvs/cine/bin/python</code>。</li>\n<li><code>ffmpeg</code>；OCR 质检用 macOS 自带的 Vision（需要 <code>swiftc</code>）。</li>\n<li>配音：小米 MiMo，密钥放 <code>MIMO_API_KEY</code> 环境变量或 <code>~/.config/ai-teardown/mimo.env</code>（<strong>不要写进项目文件</strong>）。默认音色是仓库自带的 AI 声音；想用自己的声音：<code>new_film.py --voice-ref 你的录音.wav</code>（只用你本人或已获授权的声音）。</li>\n<li>增强档（可选）：<a href=\"https://renoise.ai/mcp?utm_medium=xcom&amp;utm_source=official\">Renoise MCP</a>，注册和接入见上面的 <a href=\"#renoise%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA%E6%A1%A3%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0\">Renoise</a> 一节。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>然后在 Claude Code 里说：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>做一期知识大赏：为什么假账总被数字 1 出卖？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>第一次用会先打开本地「风格图鉴」，介绍母版、风格和档位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目录\">目录</h2>\n<pre><code>skills/vibe-knowledge/   本体：SKILL.md、references/（14 份规范与踩坑）、styles/（44 套风格）、kit/know.js、tools/、templates/、assets/（默认 BGM、默认音色）\nskills/ai-teardown/      cine 引擎（three.js 逐帧渲染）、字体、图标集、建工作区和配音脚本\ndocs/                    README 用的封面、风格墙、动图、试听音频\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"致谢\">致谢</h2>\n<p>做这个项目时参考过 lemo-opuscar、huashu-art-motion、paper2video、Paper-Cut、LuZhong-Li/vibe-knowledge-video-skill、earshot 等开源项目。每个项目参考了什么、用在哪里、什么许可证，都列在 <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md\">ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md</a>。如有不准确的地方，欢迎开 issue，我们会及时更正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"许可\">许可</h2>\n<p>代码以 <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/LICENSE\">MIT</a> 开源。示例视频、AI 生成的配图和动态镜头、默认 BGM 与默认音色的说明见 <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/NOTICE.md\">NOTICE.md</a>；第三方组件见 <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY.md\">THIRD_PARTY.md</a>；参考过的开源项目见 <a href=\"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/blob/main/ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md\">ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md</a>。</p>\n<p>作者 <a href=\"https://x.com/berryxia\">@Berryxia</a> · 用 Claude Code（Claude Opus）编排制作</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"vibe-knowledge--vibe-知识大赏","text":"vibe-knowledge · Vibe 知识大赏","level":2},{"id":"看样片","text":"看样片","level":2},{"id":"风格库44-套--8-个家族","text":"风格库：44 套 · 8 个家族","level":2},{"id":"听一听默认音色与-bgm","text":"听一听：默认音色与 BGM","level":2},{"id":"它怎么做一期","text":"它怎么做一期","level":2},{"id":"renoise增强档的生成平台","text":"Renoise：增强档的生成平台","level":2},{"id":"安装","text":"安装","level":2},{"id":"目录","text":"目录","level":2},{"id":"致谢","text":"致谢","level":2},{"id":"许可","text":"许可","level":2}]},"skills":[{"name":"ai-teardown","description":"「AI 拆机课」系列课工作室：输入一个主题（AI 产品、开源项目/书、人物历史、软件教程），产出由浅入深、每句话有出处的中文讲解视频系列 + 每节互动版 + 课程总页。流水线：收集资料 → 确认对象与课时 → 大纲 → 逐节旁白（MiMo 克隆音色 + 逐字对齐）→ scenes.json 画面编排（Notion 极简手绘引擎 / 马卡龙模板引擎，IconPark 图标与插画、Noto 动态 emoji、AntV X6 流程图、像素讲解小人、截图圈注、终端录屏）或 film.js 代码成片（cine 引擎：Three.js、粒子、着色器、真片段叠加、曲库配乐）→ Hyperframes / 无","path":"skills/ai-teardown"},{"name":"vibe-knowledge","description":"「Vibe知识大赏」精品知识短片工作室：一个知识点 → 一条 45 秒～5 分钟、有旁白、每句有出处的精品知识短片（抖音 #Vibe知识大赏 / 知识区）。从 15 条爆款反推出的 6 种脚本母版（猜谜概念片、两难选择片、痛点原理片、一条主线片、闯关片、六面轮转片）→ 带出处的事实清单 → 旁白稿 + 对抗审查 → 用户本人克隆音色配音（小米 MiMo，限免）→ 两档画面：基础档 0 积分（Opus 手写 SVG 分层插画、粒子、数据组件、默认 BGM 按片长裁剪）/ 增强档按镜头挑用 Renoise（Midjourney/GPT Image 配图、Wan 3.0/Seedance 2.5 动","path":"skills/vibe-knowledge"}],"skillCount":2,"marketplace":false,"plugin":false,"docker":false,"npm":null,"pypi":null,"install":{"remote":"https://renoise.ai/mcp"},"releases":[{"tag":"v1.0.0","name":"vibe-knowledge v1.0.0","date":"2026-10-28T09:47:18Z","url":"https://github.com/andyhuo520/vibe-knowledge/releases/tag/v1.0.0","pre":false}],"contributors":[{"login":"andyhuo520","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187917479?v=4","n":3}]}
